00:00:20.713 --> 00:00:23.476
JOINING US NOW FORMER

00:00:23.477 --> 00:00:24.991
CORONAVIRUS TASK FORCE TESTING

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:26.335
CZAR ADMIRAL GIRARD.

