00:00:28.452 --> 00:00:30.304
BACK TO A YEAR AGO WHEN YOU

00:00:30.306 --> 00:00:31.752
WERE RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE OF THE

00:00:31.753 --> 00:00:32.720
BEGINNING OF THE PANDEMIC.

00:00:32.721 --> 00:00:34.552
DID YOU EVER THINK WE WOULD BE

00:00:34.553 --> 00:00:37.440
AT THIS STAGE WHERE WE HAD THIS

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:38.833
MANY VACCINATIONS AND SHOTS IN

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:39.235
ARMS?

00:00:39.236 --> 00:00:40.561
&gt;&gt; WELL, THANKS FOR HAVING ME

00:00:40.595 --> 00:00:40.981
