00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.583
PANDEMIC BARRING EVERYONE

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:47.946
GETTING THE DISEASE.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.343
WE STARTED WORKING ON THAT

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:49.678
IMMEDIATELY.

00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:52.037
BUT I COULD HONESTLY SAY THAT

00:00:52.071 --> 00:00:54.503
NOBODY WOULD HAVE EXPECTED TO

00:00:54.537 --> 00:00:56.177
HAVE THREE AUTHORIZED VACCINES

00:00:56.212 --> 00:00:57.439
THAT WERE 100% PROTECTIVE AT

00:00:57.473 --> 00:00:58.713
THE DOSES.

00:00:58.748 --> 00:01:01.802
SO WE REALLY DO HAVE THE END IN

00:01:01.837 --> 00:01:02.618
SIGHT.

00:01:02.652 --> 00:01:05.062
IT IS A MIRACULOUS TYPE OF

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:06.057
ACCOMPLISHMENT AND WE COULDN’T

00:01:06.092 --> 00:01:06.945
HAVE IMAGINED THIS TYPE OF

00:01:06.979 --> 00:01:07.275
SUCCESS.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.360
&gt;&gt; Dana: THESE ARE THE

00:01:08.394 --> 00:01:08.921
HEADLINES.

