I WANT TO GET YOUR REACTION.

00:01:11.877 --> 00:01:13.732
HOW WORRIED SHOULD WE BE?

00:01:13.733 --> 00:01:15.503
"L. A. TIMES," "WASHINGTON

00:01:15.504 --> 00:01:18.385
POST", NEW JERSEY.COM AND WINK

