00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:26.314
WHAT SHALL WE KNOW ABOUT THIS?

00:01:26.315 --> 00:01:28.428
&gt;&gt; MUTATIONS OCCUR ALL THE TIME.

00:01:28.462 --> 00:01:30.070
THIS PARTICULAR VARIANT HAS A

00:01:30.105 --> 00:01:31.980
COUPLE OF MUTATIONS THAT WE

00:01:32.015 --> 00:01:34.627
NEED TO WATCH BUT THE BOTTOM

00:01:34.628 --> 00:01:37.607
