00:01:39.525 --> 00:01:41.054
AFRICAN, BRAZIL, U.K. OR THIS

00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:42.732
LIKELY DOUBLE VARIANT WILL ALL

00:01:42.766 --> 00:01:44.104
BE PROTECTED AGAINST BY THE

00:01:44.105 --> 00:01:44.338
VACCINES.

00:01:44.372 --> 00:01:45.462
THE VACCINES WORK.

00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:49.697
YOU HAVE TO HAVE BOTH OF THEM.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:52.792
IF YOU HAVE PFIZER OR  MODERNA.

00:01:52.793 --> 00:01:55.233
WE NEED TO BE CONCERNED ABOUT

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.235
THESE MUTANTS AND FOLLOW THEM

00:01:57.269 --> 00:01:58.377
BUT DOUBLE MUTANT SOUNDS REALLY

00:01:58.411 --> 00:01:59.510
AWFUL AND SCARY.

00:01:59.544 --> 00:02:00.881
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE SHOULD NOT

00:02:00.882 --> 00:02:01.418
BE SCARED.

00:02:01.452 --> 00:02:03.207
THEY SHOULD GET THEIR VACCINES

00:02:03.241 --> 00:02:05.334
AND THE END OF THIS WILL BECOME

00:02:05.368 --> 00:02:07.168
SOON AFTER THE VACCINES ARE

00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:07.873
MORE WIDESPREAD.

